{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0380_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0380_story_04_title", "source_sha256": "b3c68ecdd77d9417ab28ce711aefa17ccfa08641372c5dc42f980b5f1a73f393", "ja": "伝えたくないsituation", "zh": "不想传达的situation", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0380_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0380_story_04_synopsis", "source_sha256": "527eb6a270057269c673ab2424a965506280e828b51f547ec49002151a08b1e8", "ja": "仲良くなったアオを劇場に招待し、\nアイドルとしての魅力を見せつける真美。\nこれから毎回呼びつける！とはりきるものの\nアオから衝撃の事実を告げられる。\n「ウチ……もうすぐ引っ越すんだ」", "zh": "真美邀请已经和自己变得要好的阿奥来到剧场，  \n向他展示自己作为偶像的魅力。  \n虽然她兴冲冲地说以后每次都要把他叫来，  \n却从阿奥那里听到了一个令人震惊的事实。  \n“我……马上就要搬家了。”", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0380_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0380_story_04_1000_null", "source_sha256": "f82334b003bac14b1e94cd70660c4c0933a534c5af3da28711caf10c6ee1a854", "ja": "そして、数日後……", "zh": "而几天后……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0380_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0380_story_04_1001_p", "source_sha256": "7a7a55a0da68db1d5a6d7b429e20e47e6a1b5ebb715a932f4d5a0df0a632dd26", "ja": "真美が公演に友達を呼ぶなんて珍しいな。\n学校の友達か？", "zh": "真美居然会叫朋友来看公演，真少见啊。\n是学校里的朋友吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0380_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0380_story_04_1002_012mam", "source_sha256": "cf01737e1be21bfb7f3465c58b0ef8b6d83f8a1483997c533e6eea30b3363831", "ja": "ううん、公園の友達～。\nちょっと真美のスゴさをワカラセたいんだよね♪", "zh": "不是，是公园里的朋友～\n想让他们见识见识真美的厉害呢♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0380_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0380_story_04_1003_p", "source_sha256": "101d8ea4ab0ef42e438e45c4e24760a9f7759ba51a0696ac4e98d7d3bb2f6fdb", "ja": "？　よくわからないけど……まぁ、歩たちとも\n友達みたいだし、楽しんでもらえるといいな。", "zh": "？我不太明白，不过……她好像也和步她们是朋友，希望她能玩得开心。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0380_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0380_story_04_1004_p", "source_sha256": "01d5498f5cdf09558a6213727b47a57bb99cf3fe312b899d108705ea261189a8", "ja": "さて、今日の公演はハーフタイムショーの予行演習も\n兼ねた構成だ。しっかり頼んだぞ！", "zh": "那么，今天的公演也兼作中场秀的预演。可要好好加油啊！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0380_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0380_story_04_1005_012mam", "source_sha256": "34bbffe63ef152c612fc2870ad22beeb57dceb6ec5aa2373fb061ad053b09c3f", "ja": "了解だよ兄ちゃん！　あゆあゆ、まこちん、えれなん！\n今日は真美たちの、真のチカラを見せつけるのだ～！！", "zh": "了解啦，哥哥！　步步、真真、艾蕾娜！  \n今天就让你们见识一下真美她们的真正实力吧～！！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0380_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0380_story_04_1006_012mam", "source_sha256": "0522f5feb089c6d0ce8700a3a14d006211d88ef37bf2eed6509b13d9b6b2b377", "ja": "おー！", "zh": "好──！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0380_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0380_story_04_1007_034ayu", "source_sha256": "0522f5feb089c6d0ce8700a3a14d006211d88ef37bf2eed6509b13d9b6b2b377", "ja": "おー！", "zh": "好──！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
