{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0380_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0380_story_04_1010_se", "source_sha256": "08c2e6413182edcb38599d992b1294993fdad2453db3b439f2ddeb51c197ed8a", "ja": "ウワアアアアアアァァァァ！！！！！", "zh": "哇啊啊啊啊啊啊啊啊啊啊！！！！！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0380_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0380_story_04_1011_ao", "source_sha256": "daae2d6e07051fab396e278d3180488d1d41592e07ebed67fe65b3de75f0c37b", "ja": "（マミ……みんな……。こんなの、ダメじゃん）", "zh": "（真美……大家……。这样可不行啊）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0380_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0380_story_04_1012_se", "source_sha256": "08c2e6413182edcb38599d992b1294993fdad2453db3b439f2ddeb51c197ed8a", "ja": "ウワアアアアアアァァァァ！！！！！", "zh": "哇啊啊啊啊啊啊啊啊啊啊！！！！！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0380_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0380_story_04_1013_ao", "source_sha256": "6a7848e809798f09d7e6833b10c876e22d15af0b3a731febb99771a5865213cb", "ja": "（だって……最高の……）", "zh": "（因为……最棒的……）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0380_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0380_story_04_1015_null", "source_sha256": "abaf9c8e0b7588a2176c7b14f10e0dee726abb070e87d3b4c961e03e83a4bd7a", "ja": "公演終了後……", "zh": "演出结束后……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0380_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0380_story_04_1016_034ayu", "source_sha256": "33844812b3912d753a0920846e09dd67a4378715524ac391310a211648cc572f", "ja": "ほらほらこっちこっち、遠慮せず入って！", "zh": "快快，这边这边，别客气，进来吧！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0380_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0380_story_04_1017_ao", "source_sha256": "9f08137f8d88227442355d5c357fe3860283f68b6b6a6fcdaf02e7cc7838e9d6", "ja": "わ、ち、ちょっと。\nウチも入って大丈夫なん？", "zh": "等、等一下。\n我也可以进去吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0380_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0380_story_04_1018_006mak", "source_sha256": "4dd77ba380332569727c38c19d97da6622a17ffdb0dac7076d3883e9c2227c51", "ja": "大丈夫！　許可はもらってるから。\nそれにボクたちが招待したんだし、せっかくだからね。", "zh": "没问题！已经拿到许可了。\n而且是我们邀请你来的，难得有这个机会嘛。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0380_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0380_story_04_1019_018ele", "source_sha256": "12c747a13169d8c3f5b6ddd9fe687a01e2fc0c7ba2d30d2234b562fc13a0d090", "ja": "アオ、どうだった、ワタシたちのライブ？", "zh": "阿青，我们的演唱会怎么样？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0380_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0380_story_04_1020_ao", "source_sha256": "6f6926f8fad03e137d2a785ae427499194c424f4c1f4f0683ba40362c28e1610", "ja": "うん、なんか……ビックリした。\nみんなマジでアイドルなんだって、すごい納得した。", "zh": "嗯，总觉得……有点惊讶。\n我彻底明白了，大家真的都是偶像。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0380_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0380_story_04_1021_012mam", "source_sha256": "f1b6dac732339d8cb496a9961f468bde4f55de9da8e295ea879738e0cc7c3f04", "ja": "うんうん、招待した甲斐があったようですなぁ。\nもっとホメていいよ～？", "zh": "嗯嗯，看来邀请你们来还真是值得呢。再多夸夸我们也可以哦～？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0380_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0380_story_04_1022_ao", "source_sha256": "1bd61bd66fe5e1c9d3f2b453adbed9278f9cb71b2be2f10e24902aa04a03d1c2", "ja": "アユムのダンスとか、すげーかっこよかったし。\n振り付けに少しストリートの要素とか入れてた？", "zh": "步的舞蹈什么的，帅得不得了。\n编舞里是不是还加入了一点街舞元素？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0380_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0380_story_04_1023_034ayu", "source_sha256": "4dba0a4cfa57f7df45e3063e79c2056744b9dfc12cda04ae3351dbcc89443799", "ja": "え、気付いてたんだ！　アメリカで覚えたヤツだけど、\nアオってダンスも詳しいの？", "zh": "诶，你注意到了啊！那是我在美国学会的舞步。阿步，你对舞蹈也很了解吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0380_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0380_story_04_1024_ao", "source_sha256": "e9e13711ef9403a7b3a69263c176dbff46b6c186d7184fdd19afc5617f8fdb61", "ja": "そんなに詳しくないけど、ストリートバスケの動画とか\n観てると、そういうカルチャーも入ってくるから。", "zh": "我也不是特别了解，不过看看街头篮球的视频之类的，也会接触到那种文化。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0380_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0380_story_04_1025_ao", "source_sha256": "a86124476b0c019cda5086d9b55ef96e0f90a7a7b691652b7f1851311fb10d9f", "ja": "エレナはずっと楽しそうで、眩しくて……。\n……キラキラしてた。……可愛かった。", "zh": "艾丽娜一直都那么开心，耀眼夺目……\n……闪闪发光的。……好可爱。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0380_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0380_story_04_1026_018ele", "source_sha256": "3f00d53e36382d334ddf4b4d7090568685a8373c68bb87c78f48f16704dc76a3", "ja": "エヘヘ、ありがと！　そんな風にホメられると、\nちょっと恥ずかしいヨ～♪", "zh": "嘿嘿，谢谢你！被你这样夸，还真有点不好意思呢～♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0380_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0380_story_04_1027_ao", "source_sha256": "9ebd46c1b52606939fee774cb87d427406eb22eb0ffd331dee7ebb35a5bff84e", "ja": "マコトはコートでもそうだけど、キレがよくてカッコよ\nくて……でも1回ドリブルっぽいフリ入れてなかった？", "zh": "真在球场上也是这样，动作利落又帅气……不过，她是不是做了1次像运球一样的动作？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0380_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0380_story_04_1028_006mak", "source_sha256": "9f9fb43d3bc6bb060b188a2d5241fa2bb2bc9ad44cef5d571cb73fd4c9a817df", "ja": "さっすが～、気づいてくれたんだ？\nあそこはアオが見てくれてると思って、ちょっとね♪", "zh": "不愧是你～，注意到了啊？\n我想着阿欧应该在看那边，就稍微做了一下♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0380_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0380_story_04_1029_012mam", "source_sha256": "ba201a6b0b58952ff4855b927bf31c8862fb131f067b4e5202404832d07d83ff", "ja": "んでんで、真美は～？　ほらほら、照れてないで\n真美のこともホメなよ～、ほれほれほれ♪", "zh": "那真美呢～？快点快点，别害羞嘛，\n也夸夸真美呀～，快夸快夸快夸♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0380_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0380_story_04_1030_ao", "source_sha256": "68bebf6186f74077aa110e479775c836110aabad665096b24997eb4a08a6f0d8", "ja": "うん。マミは……。別に、マミだった。\nいつものマミ。", "zh": "嗯。真美她……没什么，就是平常的真美。\n还是平时的真美。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0380_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0380_story_04_1031_012mam", "source_sha256": "e2cc645eb22e468c6995eb31ac5209b80d4f1361644a904079a168bd1bbcdfdd", "ja": "なにそれ！？　も～、まだワカラセが足りないとは\n思わなかったよ～。んじゃ、次の公演にも来なさい！", "zh": "这是什么呀！？真是的～，没想到还不够让你明白呢～。那下次公演也要来哦！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0380_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0380_story_04_1033_012mam", "source_sha256": "558487f0b728bf1ed01aea36422319b73e5bdd375386f3f6cd20a300f17ad30d", "ja": "これから毎回真美の公演に呼んで、真美フラッシュを\n見せつけてあげるかんね！　覚悟するがいい！", "zh": "从今以后每次真美的演出都要叫上你，让你好好见识真美闪光！做好觉悟吧！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0380_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0380_story_04_1034_ao", "source_sha256": "c3665395e42219db9ee26377c8c29c8abf6203e84c0b1f6d72e3b1635a8c1c53", "ja": "……それは、ムリだと思う。", "zh": "……我觉得那做不到。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0380_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0380_story_04_1035_012mam", "source_sha256": "1db01ac9a8e3c2e9cefa5b5b597dfb1c66b4a8b9c25f81176753572bbc7c849c", "ja": "え？　……あ、そっか、毎回はムリだよね～。\nじゃあほぼ毎回見せつけるから！　そしたら……。", "zh": "咦？……啊，对哦，不可能每次都做到呢～  \n那我就几乎每次都展示给你看！那样的话……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0380_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0380_story_04_1036_ao", "source_sha256": "69425df8b02505668d3c85c3268a65ddff1c9394c1ba40792ef0e8e6e30c96ce", "ja": "……ゴメン、マミ……みんな。\nウチ……もうすぐ引っ越すんだ。", "zh": "……对不起，真美……大家。\n我……马上就要搬家了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
