{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0380_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0380_story_04_1041_ao", "source_sha256": "58850573c0199c319f7c0c7d9a06a7267b37abd2f801c3bcb8a0583cc291e469", "ja": "前から父ちゃんがタンシンフニン？してたんだけど。\nウチと母ちゃんも、もうすぐそっちで暮らすから。", "zh": "之前爸爸一直一个人在外地工作来着。  \n我和妈妈也马上要搬去那边住了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0380_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0380_story_04_1042_ao", "source_sha256": "17789c9104417805acc2c63a19d4237df77fabc231c1bd92a7796a751fe4f38a", "ja": "まあ……。\nずっと前から決まってたんだけど。", "zh": "哎……\n虽然是早就定好的了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0380_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0380_story_04_1043_006mak", "source_sha256": "9c910a291d2a06d225c2f73296a401f412af719a5eabc2e9e87ade42b1b8a2e4", "ja": "そうだったんだ……。えっと、残念だね。\nあ、仕方ないんだけど……せっかく仲良くなれたのに。", "zh": "原来是这样啊……那个，真遗憾。\n啊，虽然也是没办法的事……好不容易才和你成为了朋友。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0380_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0380_story_04_1044_034ayu", "source_sha256": "8a4860d567c638e6b758f1a772dea2e09764f5d7f8e8fba341eb5d6fa892c69e", "ja": "いつごろ引っ越すの？\nもしかして、来月とか？", "zh": "你大概什么时候搬家？\n难道是下个月之类的？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0380_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0380_story_04_1045_ao", "source_sha256": "4b061c9f08db0eddf41ae1d523307201efc814dc4fd83c997b80179e7d1c7973", "ja": "……来週。土曜に飛行機で。", "zh": "……下周。周六坐飞机去。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0380_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0380_story_04_1046_012mam", "source_sha256": "bb1bc5986e5b6d3f32fe58c02ffd1b2d78cf2df332649e324bd0b4378bcb483a", "ja": "え……。", "zh": "咦……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0380_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0380_story_04_1047_018ele", "source_sha256": "365d573f377354728aa73495cb64fdfb111ccfbfb8fc26ce496a01fbc00b4a61", "ja": "そんなにスグ……？\nじゃあ、もう一緒にバスケできないノ？", "zh": "这么快……？\n那以后就不能一起打篮球了咯？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0380_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0380_story_04_1048_ao", "source_sha256": "efb2331e18125cc21d68728053b6366ce9054bdd1b2663b7e115fd4841e915cf", "ja": "うん……たぶん。", "zh": "嗯……大概吧。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0380_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0380_story_04_1049_034ayu", "source_sha256": "5c141d5cf3a581e5fa068da4347b7a499de8bbcac2670635d5b51b10908bdd6d", "ja": "そ、そっか……。\nアオ、それであんな……。", "zh": "是、是这样啊……\n难怪阿歩会那样……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0380_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0380_story_04_1050_012mam", "source_sha256": "713d3a3993285c2ee69fb8cd4e9a84381fed1bf87f2bc95241665c728543e338", "ja": "……んで……。", "zh": "……然后……。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0380_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0380_story_04_1051_034ayu", "source_sha256": "3629b83bf3df05d185285ab2e80cfed3608abe0d9ce7209bb8bba9f37b43415d", "ja": "？　真美？　あ……。", "zh": "？真美？啊……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0380_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0380_story_04_1052_012mam", "source_sha256": "ccd2483ff6568f78d6a685b9e6fc8acd9beef4406f94343a050285fa8d70b0d9", "ja": "なんで、なんで黙ってたの～っ！？　もうすぐじゃん、\n全然時間ないじゃん！　もっと早く言えばいいのに～！", "zh": "为什么、为什么一直瞒着我～！？　不是马上就要到了吗，根本没时间了呀！早就该告诉我嘛～！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0380_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0380_story_04_1053_ao", "source_sha256": "029d359e52f6948d12ebb7c86864e002104da7349c9de64c4fab38c1c44ce2ef", "ja": "タ、タイミング無かったの！　だって！　……だって。\nこんな長い付き合いになるって、思ってなかったし……", "zh": "当、当时没找到合适的时机嘛！因为！……因为。\n我没想到我们会相处这么久……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0380_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0380_story_04_1054_ao", "source_sha256": "0998d3184b5f379283c7fccbde398e6ed0003efb01bfed513e7fc9d4a38cffac", "ja": "こんな……友達に、なれるとか……\n思ってなかったし……。", "zh": "没想到……竟然能和你成为朋友……。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0380_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0380_story_04_1055_012mam", "source_sha256": "6ea09a5e8978ca45822db60f4f987ab238b31efddb458b34803e9f59be7663a7", "ja": "……っ！　じ……じゃあ、バスケ勝負はどうすんの！？\n勝ち逃げする気！？　真美、まだ勝ててないのに～！", "zh": "……！那……那篮球对决要怎么办啊！？\n想赢了就跑吗！？真美都还没赢过呢～！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0380_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0380_story_04_1056_ao", "source_sha256": "9aec177b6695e3e5f80ca0b2c64546352e3891f3f310670b33a18e68de5049a0", "ja": "そんなん待ってられないし！\nマミ、バスケはまだ全然ヘタだから！", "zh": "那种事我可等不了！  \n真美打篮球还差得远呢！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0380_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0380_story_04_1057_ao", "source_sha256": "a77ae89bde29aa0a1bdd46f0d12c3070256db4c9f740f6f2bcb6429e65f59208", "ja": "すっ、すごいけど！　お、面白くてかわいくて、\nマミはいつもスゴいけど！！　バスケはヘタ！！", "zh": "虽、虽然很厉害！又、又有趣又可爱，\n真美一直都很厉害！！但篮球很差劲！！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0380_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0380_story_04_1058_012mam", "source_sha256": "9863d360da5f79a177f5eee2f0154bebd813078f76fa8e1b466b24f5f9595934", "ja": "な……なにいってんの！？　アオぽんの……、\nアオぽんのバカ！！　ピコモン教えてやったのに！！", "zh": "什……什么啊！？阿青……，\n阿青你这个笨蛋！！我明明都教过你皮可蒙了！！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0380_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0380_story_04_1059_012mam", "source_sha256": "1606810fa0baa7b771757dd2faf08bd34890b6d98097eb5c67ca88e446723b04", "ja": "ずるいよ。もっと……もっと……、\nうう、もういいっ！　勝手に引っ越せっ！", "zh": "太狡猾了。再多……再多……，\n呜呜，算了！你爱搬走就搬走吧！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0380_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0380_story_04_1060_034ayu", "source_sha256": "756698df64b2d839ac44f97f65372b2152dd4ae9527902d731f313647adb3a20", "ja": "あ、真美っ！？", "zh": "啊，真美！？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
